            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Background: Identification of a simplified prediction model for lymph node metastasis (LNM) for patients with early colorectal cancer (CRC) is urgently needed to determine treatment and follow-up strategies</rdf:li>
